    "statement": "In the bioassay of the testicular diffusing factor, six injections were made into each of six rabbits, one injection at each of six skin positions (rows a to f), and the blister area (cm²) was measured. The order of injection (i to vi) is the treatment, rabbits are the columns and positions the rows of a 6 × 6 Latin square. Test the order of injection, the positions and the rabbits at α = 0.05. Source: Biochemical Journal 34:1464-1471.",
